{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinos Falling</strong> is a cooperative 3D platformer for 3 players. Take control of clumsy dinosaurs trying to escape a modern city packed with traps, surprises, and hilarious deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rule is simple: <i>\u201cReach the exit and survive.\u201d</i> But every level is full of tricks, unexpected obstacles, and situations where nothing goes as planned. Chaos and laughter are guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levels</strong><br>Each stage is handcrafted and offers new traps and challenges. From city streets to rooftops and construction sites \u2014 every setting throws in fresh obstacles and reasons to laugh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946530/extras/3bbfa80a760d1bcdea54dff506e2da1d.poster.avif?t=1772786624\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946530/extras/3bbfa80a760d1bcdea54dff506e2da1d.webm?t=1772786624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946530/extras/3bbfa80a760d1bcdea54dff506e2da1d.mp4?t=1772786624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong><br>Play together with friends. Cooperation won\u2019t be easy \u2014 sometimes your friend is the biggest trap of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946530/extras/4f03b4ca9efc6067ef06141282adffee.poster.avif?t=1772786624\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946530/extras/4f03b4ca9efc6067ef06141282adffee.webm?t=1772786624\" type=\"video/webm; 